landing page (`index.html`, `README.md`) and nothing else.

IT DOES NOT APPLY TO KONI-FORGE ITSELF.

KONI-Forge is proprietary software of the Korea Institute of Science and
Technology Information (KISTI), Large-scale AI Research Center, and is NOT
published here. All rights to that software are reserved. No right to use,
copy, modify, distribute, reverse engineer, or commercially exploit KONI-Forge
is granted by this repository or by this licence.

Access to the running demonstration is a limited, revocable permission to
evaluate the system for non-commercial research or academic purposes. It is NOT
a licence to the software. In particular, the following remain prohibited
without the prior written permission of KISTI:

  (a) any commercial use of the system or of its outputs;
  (b) redistribution, resale, or sublicensing of the system or its outputs;
  (c) reverse engineering, decompilation, or disassembly;
  (d) extraction of model weights, source code, prompts, or configuration;
  (e) automated or bulk access, or access to accounts, data, or functions other
      than those assigned to the user.

KONI-Forge may be subject to the Act on the Innovation of National Research and
Development of the Republic of Korea. Any use, transfer, or licensing may
require a separate technology transfer or licensing agreement with KISTI.

